<div class="pz-help-page page-width" style="max-width: 860px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; font-family: 'Barlow', system-ui, sans-serif;">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
    <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #ef4444; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">Customer Support &amp; Knowledge Base</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0.35rem 0 0.5rem;">How Can We Help You?</h1>
    <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 1rem;">Find fast answers about shipping, paper quality, split poster installations, and custom orders.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- 3 Support Cards -->
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
    <div style="border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; background: #fff;">
      <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">📦</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 0.25rem;">Track An Order</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Real-time shipping status and courier tracking links.</p>
      <a href="/pages/track-order" style="display: inline-block; padding: 8px 16px; background: #000; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; text-decoration: none;">Track Now</a>
    </div>

    <div style="border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; background: #fff;">
      <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">🖼️</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 0.25rem;">Artwork &amp; Quality</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 1rem;">300 GSM matte specifications and sizing guides.</p>
      <a href="#faqs" style="display: inline-block; padding: 8px 16px; background: #f1f5f9; color: #000; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; text-decoration: none;">View Specs</a>
    </div>

    <div style="border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; background: #fff;">
      <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">💬</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 0.25rem;">Direct Help</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Reach our executive team on email or WhatsApp.</p>
      <a href="mailto:support@posterized.in" style="display: inline-block; padding: 8px 16px; background: #000; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; text-decoration: none;">Email Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Frequently Asked Questions -->
  <div id="faqs" style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; padding: 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 1.5rem;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem; padding-bottom: 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
      <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 0.4rem;">What material are the posters printed on?</h4>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">All posters and split sets are printed on heavy 300 GSM matte art paper board. They are thick, non-reflective under bedroom LEDs/lights, fade-resistant, and won't curl over time.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem; padding-bottom: 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
      <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 0.4rem;">How do I stick them to my wall without damaging the paint?</h4>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">Every order includes complimentary high-tack, paint-safe double-sided wall tape pre-cut for easy application. Simply peel and stick directly to your clean, dry wall.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem; padding-bottom: 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
      <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 0.4rem;">How does the "Buy 4 Get 3 Free" or "Buy 5 Get 5 Free" offer work?</h4>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">No coupon code is required! Simply add all 7 posters to your cart for "Buy 4 Get 3 Free" (or 10 posters for "Buy 5 Get 5 Free"). Our checkout algorithm automatically marks the free items as ₹0.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem; padding-bottom: 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
      <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 0.4rem;">What is the estimated delivery time?</h4>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">Orders are printed and dispatched within 24-48 business hours. Delivery typically takes 3-5 business days across major cities in India via BlueDart, Delhivery, or Xpressbees.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
      <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 0.4rem;">Can I get a replacement if my package is damaged in transit?</h4>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">Yes, 100%! All orders are packed in rigid protective packaging. If any print arrives creased or damaged, send a picture to support@posterized.in within 48 hours of delivery and we will send a free replacement immediately.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Help & Support Page",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
